    "description": "<p>Mystics use mind over body techniques to affect their own bodies and, with experience, the bodies of others.</p><p>They use martial arts as a focus to achieve the states of mind they need to achieve to do this, and the result is that they are able to fight with superhuman speed and agility when using</p><p>martial arts, eventually performing much better unarmed than they would with weapons.</p><p>Within an adventuring party, mystics can prove to be able in melee combat, though not quite as able as fighters until they reach higher levels of experience; and back this talent up with useful scouting skills.</p><p>Enhanced Martial Arts Abilities por nível (referência, não usado por automação do sistema):</p><table><tr><th>Level</th><th>Armour Class</th><th>Move</th><th>Unarmed Attacks</th><th>Unarmed Damage</th><th>Unarmed Hit As</th></tr><tr><td>1</td><td>9</td><td>40'</td><td>1</td><td>1d4</td><td>–</td></tr><tr><td>2</td><td>8</td><td>45'</td><td>1</td><td>1d4+1</td><td>Silver</td></tr><tr><td>3</td><td>7</td><td>45'</td><td>1</td><td>1d6</td><td>Silver</td></tr><tr><td>4</td><td>6</td><td>50'</td><td>1</td><td>1d6+1</td><td>Silver</td></tr><tr><td>5</td><td>5</td><td>55'</td><td>2</td><td>1d8</td><td>+1</td></tr><tr><td>6</td><td>4</td><td>55'</td><td>2</td><td>1d8+1</td><td>+1</td></tr><tr><td>7</td><td>3</td><td>60'</td><td>2</td><td>1d10</td><td>+1</td></tr><tr><td>8</td><td>2</td><td>65'</td><td>2</td><td>1d12</td><td>+2</td></tr><tr><td>9</td><td>1</td><td>65'</td><td>3</td><td>2d8</td><td>+2</td></tr><tr><td>10</td><td>0</td><td>70'</td><td>3</td><td>2d10</td><td>+2</td></tr><tr><td>11</td><td>–1</td><td>75'</td><td>3</td><td>2d12</td><td>+3</td></tr><tr><td>12</td><td>–2</td><td>80'</td><td>3</td><td>3d8+1</td><td>+3</td></tr><tr><td>13</td><td>–3</td><td>85'</td><td>4</td><td>4d6+2</td><td>+3</td></tr><tr><td>14</td><td>–4</td><td>90'</td><td>4</td><td>5d6</td><td>+4</td></tr><tr><td>15</td><td>–5</td><td>95'</td><td>4</td><td>4d8</td><